			"offsets": {
				"from": 3440,
				"to": 6880
			},
			"text": "但有篇论文说,它训练不足10倍"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:06,880",
				"to": "00:00:10,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 6880,
				"to": 10080
			},
			"text": "参数这么多,怎么还会训练不足?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:10,080",
				"to": "00:00:14,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 10080,
				"to": 14720
			},
			"text": "阶段期,第13课, Scaling loss,扩展定律"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:14,720",
				"to": "00:00:19,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 14720,
				"to": 19040
			},
			"text": "2020年的论文说,模型越大,损失越低"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:19,040",
				"to": "00:00:22,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 19040,
				"to": 22560
			},
			"text": "2022年的论文说,你训练不足了"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:22,560",
				"to": "00:00:26,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 22560,
				"to": 26480
			},
			"text": "训练算力大约等于6成参数,成token"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:26,480",
				"to": "00:00:30,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 26480,
				"to": 30640
			},
			"text": "同样一笔算力,可以堆参数,也可以堆数据"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:30,640",
				"to": "00:00:33,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 30640,
				"to": 33680
			},
			"text": "到底怎么分?这件事并不显然"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:33,680",
				"to": "00:00:38,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 33680,
				"to": 38720
			},
			"text": "Caplan等人2020年的结论是,把参数往死里推"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:38,720",
				"to": "00:00:43,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 38720,
				"to": 43920
			},
			"text": "GPT3就是按这个思路做的1750亿参数"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:43,920",
				"to": "00:00:49,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 43920,
				"to": 49600
			},
			"text": "它的训练数据只有3000亿token,每个参数配1.7个token"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:49,600",
				"to": "00:00:53,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 49600,
				"to": 53440
			},
			"text": "Hoffman等人训了一组,叫Chinchilla的模型"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:53,440",
				"to": "00:00:59,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 53440,
				"to": 59120
			},
			"text": "他们发现,最优比例不是1.7,而是每个参数20个token"
